<title>USA: United National Bancorp sets stock split.</title>
<headline>United National Bancorp sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEWATER, N.J. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>United National Bancorp said Thursday its board had declared a two-for-one stock split, payable July 1, record June 13.</p>
<p>The number of shares outstanding will increase to nine million as a result of the split, the bank holding company said.</p>
</text>
